        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9028P, Bilbao Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bilbao Door Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. Choose from a wide array of finish colors including oil rubbed bronze, satin brass, and the ever popular satin nickel. The Bilbao Door Handle is great for industrial chic decor. It is easy to install with two thru-bolts. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima II 9028P Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9028P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9028P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"  (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9028P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/bilbao-back-to-back-pull-set-omnia-btb-9028p\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
